        "\n",
        "**Prompt formula**: `Subject + Movement + Background + Camera`\n",
        "\n",
        "Append `--` parameters to the prompt text to control video specs:\n",
        "```\n",
        "--resolution 720p  --duration 5  --camerafixed false\n",
        "```"
